    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 32,
      "title": {
        "en": "Consistent grooming cuts and styling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently report clean, well-shaped haircuts, gentle coat de-shedding, and tidy nail grinds. Dogs and cats typically return looking neat and smelling pleasant, with owners highlighting precise coat trimming. A few reviewers expressed frustration after a haircut was cut shorter than requested or uneven."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise the groomers for their patience with anxious or fearful dogs and cats. Reviewers mention that sensitive pets receive calming attention and treats throughout the appointment. While most animals handle the visits calmly, one owner noted their pet remained fearful after a grooming session."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming and attentive salon team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews consistently describe the front desk and grooming staff as friendly, polite, and accommodating of scheduling requests. Visitors appreciate the helpful demeanor of team members during routine visits. However, occasional complaints mention difficulties with booking communications and receptionist handoffs."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the salon accept walk-in visits for nail trims?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note that quick nail trims and grinds are frequently accepted as walk-ins depending on daily availability."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do groomers work with both dogs and cats?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the salon handles grooming appointments and nail care for both feline and canine pets."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
